A||||1||loafer87gt||Good day for my GT!||||1||
Z||000000||loafer87gt||02-16-2000||11:34 AM||||Hi guys, I had so many compliments on my car yesterday I had to share them with you guys. The streets are almost thawed out here so I had the car all washed up, the rims cleaned, the tires all glossed, and I went out cruising. The sky was also overcast, and burgundy paint looks really sweet when the wheather is like that. Anyways, when I was in at a gas station paying for my fuel I heard a group of younger people trying to figure out what my car was. They were possitive it was an MR2, but couldn't figure out why it had the PONTIAC taillights, they thought it was pretty sweet anyways,. When I left the station I pulled a U-turn at the intersection and floored it so they could hear the sweet exhaust note. Not smart I guess. I noticed a set of red and blues in my rear view mirror. The cop gave me a ticket for doing an illegal u-turn, and proceeding to break the speed limit. After giving me the ticket he complimented me on the car saying it was the most beautiful fiero he had ever seen! Uhh, thanks. Lastly, when I parked at the university, there was a group of fine looking ladies who were talking to amongst themselves about my car. With the exception of the tickets, a pretty good day for the ol plastic fantastic!||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||02-16-2000||12:25 PM||||"When I left the station I pulled a U-turn at the intersection and floored it so they could hear the sweet exhaust note. "<P>That totally sounds like something I would do.  Don't feel bad!  My 87 GT is maroon too. I've actually been thinking of changing it to something else...||||reg||1
